Usage: ocamllaws <command> [<options>]
Commands are:
  extract  Extract the laws of a compiled unit
Run 'ocamllaws <command> -help' for the options of a command.

Usage: ocamllaws extract -format <format> [-o <file>] <unit>.cmo|<unit>.cmx
Extract the laws of a compiled unit.
Options are:
  -format {laws-file}
            Which laws to extract
  -o <file> Write to <file> instead of standard output
  -help     Display this list of options
  --help    Display this list of options
